## Slide 5 — What we reviewed (Default Slide, Title + Subtitle)
- Title: "ZDMS_UPLOAD_FILES"
- Upsubtitle: "Executable report, package Z001, destination DS4_CLH"
- Body: 2 columns of blocks with icons
  - Left block — "What it does" (icon: Processes / Gear_Process_1)
    - Pulls files via SFTP GET → SAP DMS upload
    - Pushes files via SFTP PUT
    - Driven by SM69 entries `ZSFTP_DMS_GET` / `ZSFTP_DMS_PUT`
  - Right block — "How it does it" (icon: Buildings_Construction / Hammer_Screwdriver)
    - `SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE` → OS shell
    - `OPEN/READ/TRANSFER/DELETE DATASET` on app server
    - Reads config from standard `TVARVC`

