## Slide 12 — Performance findings list (Default Slide, Title only)
- Title: "Performance — all 4 findings"
- Body: BlockGrid 2×2 of blocks
  - "HIGH — FORMAT_MESSAGE called per row"
    - Inside `LOOP AT pt_data`; same message formatter invoked for every entry.
  - "HIGH — ZDMS_UPLOAD_DOCUMENTS called per row"
    - Upload FM invoked per row — should use a mass/table-parameter API.
  - "MEDIUM — `SELECT *` on TVARVC"
    - Wide fetch where only `sign/opti/low/high` are needed.
  - "MEDIUM — `SELECT *` on DMS_DOC_FILES"
    - Wide fetch with FOR ALL ENTRIES; only `filename` is used downstream.

