## Slide 15 — Clean Core findings list (Default Slide, Title only)
- Title: "Clean Core — all 6 findings"
- Body: BlockGrid 3×2 of compact blocks
  - "HIGH — SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE (SFTP GET)"
    - OS-shell access via SM69 — not allowed in Cloud.
  - "HIGH — SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE (SFTP PUT)"
    - Same shell-access blocker on the push path.
  - "HIGH — OPEN/READ/TRANSFER DATASET (app-server FS)"
    - Direct AL11-style file I/O — disallowed in Cloud.
  - "HIGH — DELETE DATASET (post-process cleanup)"
    - App-server file deletion — disallowed in Cloud.
  - "HIGH — DELETE DATASET (error path)"
    - Second AL11 deletion site, same blocker.
  - "HIGH — Direct SELECT on TVARVC"
    - Standard config table read without released API.

